# Libraries available to trial code in the tabular sandbox image (PLAN.md S1.2, spec §8.2, §22).
# Regenerate the hash-locked file with `make sandbox-lock` after editing this list; the image installs
# ONLY from requirements-tabular.lock (pip --require-hashes), never from this file.
# Later steps add what they need here (e.g. S1.3's serialization/parquet libraries).
pandas
numpy
scikit-learn
xgboost-cpu  # the official CPU-only XGBoost build (no NVIDIA libraries); GPU images come in S3.F1
lightgbm
optuna
